<!--
  ArcadeMaster - SECOND SCREEN, MAIN MENU: the hero show of the highlighted entry (backdrop, logo, facts, consoles, characters)
  over random fanart from its games, plus the touch bar (BACK | PREV | START = open | NEXT | RANDOM).
-->
